       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day for adults. At that dose the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially, and normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove them.\n\nWhich of these did you mean?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum prescription dose.\n- **400 to 600 mg PO four times daily**, the typical dose for analgesia or inflammation.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n- **1600 mg PO four times daily as written.** If this is intentional, tell me and add a note with the rationale. I'll enter it with that note.\n\nOnce you confirm the dose, I'll enter it right away."
